+[Resolve]
+# Quad9 over TLS for everything not handled by a per-link resolver. NetworkManager and wg-quick hand their
+# pushed DNS (incl. homelab domains like search.lsck0.dev) to resolved as per-link servers with routing domains,
+# so those names resolve against the homelab/VPN resolver and everything else goes to Quad9 encrypted.
+DNS=9.9.9.9#dns.quad9.net 2620:fe::fe#dns.quad9.net
+FallbackDNS=149.112.112.112#dns.quad9.net 2620:fe::9#dns.quad9.net
